title: "eMRTD differential harness"
message: >-
  If you use this software or its locked-run artifacts, please cite it using
  GitHub Release v1.0.12 (clean-provenance re-execution of the v1.0.7 defect
  and v1.0.9 remeasurement deposits; identical scores). The archived source
  tree on Zenodo is tag v1.0.9 (10.5281/zenodo.22097289); this tip records
  v1.0.12 yet.
